# Deny everything, then allow only what the image build needs.
#
# An allowlist rather than a denylist because the denylist it replaced listed
# only pb_data/ and test_pb_data/, so .env (SMTP password, MailerSend and
# LaunchDarkly keys, Sentry DSN) and data/ (a ~880 MB database dump) were both
# copied into the builder stage by "COPY . .". Anything added to the repo from
# now on stays out of the build context until it is named here.
*

# Go module definition (copied first for dependency layer caching)
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Application source. No go:embed anywhere, so nothing else is needed to compile.
!main.go
!internal/
!migrations/

# Email templates: parsed by relative path at runtime, so they ship in the
# final image and must be present in the build context.
!templates/
